:''For other uses, see [[Summer Break Cats (Disambiguation)]].''
'''Summer Break Cats Castaway''' (ねこのなつやすみ サバイバル, ''Neko no Natsuyasumi Sabaibaru'', '''Summer Break Cats Survival''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was originally added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] and updated in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

==Overview==
===About===
The Summer Break Cats Castaway Gauntlet contains a total of 20 stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

